42:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["No store emits any of them unless you explicitly wrap it in the\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"cache_metrics"}]," store."]}]," That wrapper is the only caller of the instruments, and\nthe design is deliberately opt-in so unwrapped stores carry no timers or\nattribute allocation in their hot path. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"None of the shipped deployment\nconfigs wrap anything"}]," (the only ",["$","code",null,{"children":"cache_metrics"}]," block in the tree is in the\nconfig-parser coverage fixture ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge-config/examples/stores-config.json5"}],"),\nso out of the box an operator gets zero hit rate and zero latency data."]}]
